      "text": "Data Cleansing\n\nModule Name: utils_data_cleansing\n\nMethods:\ndef clean_transform_positions():  Standardize various Quarterback, qb, QB to be QB, Running Back to RB, etc.  Leverage position_map.json to do this\n",
